  <body>
    <div>
      <p begin="00:00.000" end="00:08.000" ttm:agent="v1">[Chorus]</p>
      <p begin="00:12.330" end="00:15.148" ttm:agent="v1">I don't trust a soul, I don't trust nobody</p>
      <p begin="00:15.148" end="00:18.111" ttm:agent="v1">Threw up off some pills, I don't trust my own body</p>
      <p begin="00:18.111" end="00:21.064" ttm:agent="v1">You would take her shoppin', you took her to Chrome probably</p>
      <p begin="00:21.064" end="00:24.300" ttm:agent="v1">It only took me one call, got the dome out of her</p>
      <p begin="00:24.300" end="00:27.146" ttm:agent="v1">Just hit this ho, her boyfriend book me for a show, ah</p>
      <p begin="00:27.146" end="00:30.196" ttm:agent="v1">I'm rockin' white and gold, it look like I got mob ties</p>
      <p begin="00:30.196" end="00:33.282" ttm:agent="v1">Water comin' in and out, it never was a drought</p>
      <p begin="00:33.282" end="00:36.096" ttm:agent="v1">**** the opposition, hit they strip then air it out</p>
      <p begin="00:36.096" end="00:37.596" ttm:agent="v1"/>
      <p begin="00:36.386" end="00:37.886" ttm:agent="v1">[Verse]</p>
      <p begin="00:36.607" end="00:38.753" ttm:agent="v1">Pay attention, pay attention</p>
      <p begin="00:38.753" end="00:41.848" ttm:agent="v1">Pay attention, finna show you how to get it</p>
      <p begin="00:41.848" end="00:44.906" ttm:agent="v1">First you make a hundred movin', whippin' chickens</p>
      <p begin="00:44.906" end="00:47.626" ttm:agent="v1">Then you stay down, stack your racks, don't ever spend 'em</p>
      <p begin="00:47.626" end="00:50.594" ttm:agent="v1">Forgiatos, Panoramas smooth spinnin'</p>
      <p begin="00:50.594" end="00:53.570" ttm:agent="v1">Extra green up in my pocket look like spinach</p>
      <p begin="00:53.570" end="00:56.632" ttm:agent="v1">I put gold all in my mouth, I hate the dentist</p>
      <p begin="00:56.632" end="00:59.769" ttm:agent="v1">Gon' pour two more lines thеn I'm finished</p>
      <p begin="00:59.769" end="01:03.586" ttm:agent="v1">I said, &quot;Better latе than never, better late than never&quot;</p>
      <p begin="01:03.586" end="01:06.614" ttm:agent="v1">Yeah, better late than never, better late than never</p>
      <p begin="01:06.614" end="01:09.501" ttm:agent="v1">I said, &quot;Better late than never, better late than never&quot;</p>
      <p begin="01:09.501" end="01:15.164" ttm:agent="v1">Yeah, better late than never, better late than never</p>
      <p begin="01:15.164" end="01:18.550" ttm:agent="v1">Yeah, I call my black b***h &quot;Wet Throat&quot;</p>
      <p begin="01:18.550" end="01:21.844" ttm:agent="v1">She ain't pop it out, I left her at the Loews</p>
      <p begin="01:21.844" end="01:24.623" ttm:agent="v1">They won't get up out my way, I run 'em over</p>
      <p begin="01:24.623" end="01:26.123" ttm:agent="v1">[Chorus]</p>
      <p begin="01:24.946" end="01:27.934" ttm:agent="v1">I don't trust a soul, I don't trust nobody</p>
      <p begin="01:27.934" end="01:30.984" ttm:agent="v1">Threw up off some pills, I don't trust my own body</p>
      <p begin="01:30.984" end="01:34.047" ttm:agent="v1">You would take her shoppin', you took her to Chrome probably</p>
      <p begin="01:34.047" end="01:36.912" ttm:agent="v1">It only took me one call, got the dome out of her</p>
      <p begin="01:36.912" end="01:39.996" ttm:agent="v1">Just hit this ho, her boyfriend book me for a show, ah</p>
      <p begin="01:39.996" end="01:43.036" ttm:agent="v1">I'm rockin' white and gold, it look like I got mob ties</p>
      <p begin="01:43.036" end="01:46.081" ttm:agent="v1">Water comin' in and out, it never was a drought</p>
      <p begin="01:46.081" end="01:48.898" ttm:agent="v1">**** the opposition, hit they strip then air it out</p>
      <p begin="01:48.898" end="01:50.398" ttm:agent="v1"/>
      <p begin="01:49.214" end="01:50.714" ttm:agent="v1">[Outro]</p>
      <p begin="01:49.395" end="01:52.022" ttm:agent="v1">I said, &quot;Better late than never, better late than never&quot;</p>
      <p begin="01:52.022" end="01:55.072" ttm:agent="v1">Yeah, better late than never, better late than never</p>
      <p begin="01:55.072" end="01:58.176" ttm:agent="v1">I said, &quot;Better late than never, better late than never&quot;</p>
      <p begin="01:58.176" end="02:02.176" ttm:agent="v1">Yeah, better late than never, better late than never</p>
    </div>
